---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Health Insurance in Cambodia | AG Cambodia"
  description="International, family, travel and employee health insurance in Cambodia. AG Cambodia compares A-rated insurers so you get the right coverage at the right price."
  quoteHref="#contact"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span>Health Insurance</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Health Insurance</p>
      <h1>International Health Insurance for Expats</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Health is likely at the top of your priority list, especially living in a sub-tropical country like Cambodia. Healthcare costs can reach very high amounts, and insurers differ in coverage, protocol and price — choosing the right plan isn't easy, and that's where AG Cambodia helps.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who are you looking to cover -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who are you covering?</p>
      <h2>Choose the right path</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Insurance companies don't all provide the same coverage, criteria or premiums. Pick the situation that matches yours and we'll walk you through the options.</p>
      <p class="section-lead">We take a comprehensive approach to understanding your personal, family or corporate healthcare needs, considering individual circumstances, medical history and long-term protection requirements. Our expertise enables us to recommend insurance solutions that provide appropriate and sustainable healthcare protection.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid">
        <article class="cov-card cov-card-has-image">
          <div class="cov-card-image">
            <img src="/assets/private-health-insurance.webp" alt="Doctor and nurse reviewing patient records on a tablet" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <span class="cov-tag">Residents &amp; Families</span>
          <h3>Non-Resident Health Insurance</h3>
          <p>You and your family moved to Cambodia and you're looking for reliable, long-term international health coverage.</p>
          <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/" class="link-arrow">Explore long-term plans <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card cov-card-has-image">
          <div class="cov-card-image">
            <img src="/assets/travel-insurance.webp" alt="Couple smiling with boarding passes at the airport" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <span class="cov-tag">Travelers</span>
          <h3>Tourist Health Insurance</h3>
          <p>Traveling outside your country of residence for business or leisure? We have great packages for short-term insurance.</p>
          <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/travel-insurance-cambodia/" class="link-arrow">Explore travel plans <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card cov-card-has-image">
          <div class="cov-card-image">
            <img src="/assets/employee-benefit.webp" alt="Two colleagues chatting in an office corridor" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <span class="cov-tag">Employers</span>
          <h3>Employee's Health Insurance</h3>
          <p>Employing staff, whether for your business or your household? AG Cambodia can help you get them properly covered at all times.</p>
          <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/employee-staff-insurance/" class="link-arrow">Explore group plans <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why it matters -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why it matters</p>
        <h2>The stakes are higher in Cambodia</h2>
        <p>Health is likely to be at the top of your priority list, especially when living in a south east Asian sub-tropical country such as Cambodia. Moreover, the current medical and sanitation environment, though having made huge progress in the past decade, is still lacking facilities and expertise — meaning that in case of severe emergency, Bangkok remains the closest facility.</p>
        <p>Health insurance is your first insurance need, whether for your family or for your corporate expatriate team. Healthcare costs can reach very high amounts, and selecting the right plan can be quite an exercise: insurance companies don't provide the same coverage, don't all have the same protocols, criteria and administrative process, and premiums differ from one provider to another.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>Our featured insurance partners</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li><a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/acs-health-insurance/">ACS Expat Health Insurance</a></li>
          <li><a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/april-health-insurance/">APRIL Expat Health Insurance</a></li>
          <li><a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/luma-health-insurance/">LUMA Expat Health Insurance</a></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="contact">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free health insurance quote within 24 hours</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your situation. Compare offers from multiple A-rated insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential — your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your needs and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
